  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="unit_tun_cb7a685bbe3f28cdb235454c774ff4abfff2f5d2e6020b468bc0cdb2286692b74c">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>tun, as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | tun, as a packing unit for cloth of no particular size | tun as a packing unit for liquid goods, not wine | tun as a liquid measure, here of beer 528, 553 (see also dolium) | a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | of flax | of iron | a packing unit for liquid goods | tun as a measure of fruit (see also dolium) | tun, a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size (see also dolium) | a packing unit for liquid goods of no particular size (see also dol(l)ium) | tun as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size (see also dolium) | tun as a liquid measure, not of wine (see also dolium) | tun as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | a unit of transport for liquid goods | of beer 509, 510 (see also dolium) | tun as a liquid measure, not of wine (see also tonne) | tun as a liquid measure, not of wine | tun as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size (see also tonne) | of Bilbao iron | of Prussian iron | of Spanish iron | tun as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size 108, 117, 129, 132, 134. | tun as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size (see also ton(n)e) | as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | as a packing unit of fructus (see also tonne) | tun as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size, here of Caen stone | tun as a packing unit | tun as a liquid measure of capacity for wine (= 2 pipes or 4 hogsheads or 252 gallons) (Zupko 423-6) | tun as a packing unit for liquids, here oil | tun as packing unit for dry goods, here raisins | of wine a tun of wine (equivalent to 2 pipes, 4 hogsheads or 252 gallons) | a tun of wine (equivalent to 2 pipes, 4 hogsheads or 252 gallons) | a measure of wine (252 gallons) | tun as a liquid measure, not of wine 542 (see also to(o)ne) | tun as a unit of transport for liquid goods, not wine | as a packing unit for liquid goods (not wine) of no particular size | tun as measure of capacity for figs, raisins, fruit in general (according to E122/203/2 f. 11v: 1 dolium fructus = 10 sorte = 30 pecie) | tun, as a packing unit for liquid goods, not wine | ton as a measure of weight (20 cwt), e.g. of iron (Zupko 416-9) | empty tun, as an article of commerce (exported) | broken tun, as an article of commerce | ton as a measure of weight (20 cwt) (Zupko 416-9) | as a measure of calx (lime) | ton as a measure of weight (20 cwt) (Zupko 416-9) here as a measure of lime (calsis) | ton as a measure of weight (20 cwt) (Zupko 416-9) 9, 14, 15, 16, 22, 30, 36, 37, 38, 39, 41, 42, 43, 45, 46, 47, 48, 50, 51, 53, 54, 57, 61, | ton as a measure of weight (20 cwt), as a measure of iron, Cane stone (Zupko 416-9) | tun as a liquid measure (not of wine) | tun as packing unit | tun as a measure of capacity for wine (= 2 pipes or 4 hogsheads or 252 gallons) (Zupko 423-6) | as a packing unit of fructus | tun as a liquid measure, not of wine, here of beer | of oil | tun as a liquid measure, here of beer | a measure of volume for wine, equivalent to 2 pipes, 4 hogsheads or 252 gallons</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
